## 2. Architecture

### High-Level Architecture

```
┌─────────────┐
│   User      │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│   Frontend (Next.js on Vercel)     │
│   - React 19                        │
│   - Tailwind CSS                    │
│   - Supabase Client                 │
└──────┬──────────────────────────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│   Backend API (FastAPI on Railway) │
│   - REST endpoints                  │
│   - OAuth integrations              │
│   - Document management             │
└──────┬──────────────────────────────┘
       │
       ├─────────────────┬─────────────────┐
       ▼                 ▼                 ▼
┌────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐
│  Supabase  │  │ Celery Worker │  │   Redis     │
│ (Database) │  │  (Railway)    │  │  (Broker)   │
│    +RLS    │  │   - gevent    │  └─────────────┘
└────────────┘  │   - 10 workers│
                │   - Tasks:    │
                │     • Ingest  │
                │     • Parse   │
                │     • Embed   │
                └───────────────┘
```

### Deployment Topology

**Frontend:**
- Platform: Vercel
- Repo: GitHub main branch
- Build: Next.js static generation + SSR
- Domain: app.axiohub.io

**Backend API:**
- Platform: Railway
- Repo: GitHub main branch (backend/)
- Runtime: Python 3.11 + Gunicorn
- Port: 8080

**Worker:**
- Platform: Railway (separate container)
- Repo: Same as backend
- Runtime: Python 3.11 + Celery
- Pool: gevent (10 concurrent workers)

**Database:**
- Platform: Supabase (managed PostgreSQL)
- Features: RLS, Realtime, Auth

