## 5. Data Flow

### 5.1 Document Ingestion Flow

```
User selects files in UI
       ↓
Frontend calls API: POST /api/v1/integrations/{provider}/ingest
       ↓
Backend creates ingestion_jobs record
       ↓
Backend queues unified_ingest_task → Celery
       ↓
Celery Worker:
  1. Fetches files from connector (Google Drive/Notion/etc)
  2. Creates ingestion_file_status records
  3. Dispatches process_file_task for each file (FAN-OUT)
       ↓
process_file_task (parallel for each file):
  1. Downloads/parses file content
  2. Splits into chunks (~500 tokens each)
  3. Generates OpenAI embeddings
  4. Inserts into documents + document_chunks tables
       ↓
finalize_job_task (callback after all files):
  1. Updates ingestion_jobs status
  2 Sends notification
```

### 5.2 Chat/Search Flow

```
User asks question in chat
       ↓
Frontend: POST /api/v1/chat
       ↓
Backend:
  1. Generate embedding for query (OpenAI)
  2. Vector similarity search (pgvector)
  3. Retrieve top K chunks
  4. Build prompt with context
  5. Call LLM (OpenAI/Groq)
  6. Stream response back
       ↓
Frontend: Display streaming response
```

