## 6. Components

### 6.1 Frontend Components

**Key React Components:**

1. **ChatArea** (`components/chat/ChatArea.tsx`)
   - Main chat interface
   - Message streaming
   - Source citations
   - Virtual scrolling (TanStack Virtual)

2. **DriveExplorer** ([components/drive-explorer.tsx](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/components/drive-explorer.tsx))
   - Google Drive file browser
   - File selection
   - Ingestion trigger
   - Progress modal integration

3. **IngestionProgressModal** ([components/ingest-modal.tsx](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/components/ingest-modal.tsx))
   - Real-time progress tracking
   - Per-file status display
   - Supabase Realtime subscription

4. **DLQDashboard** ([components/admin/DLQDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/components/admin/DLQDashboard.tsx))
   - Failed task management
   - Retry/resolve actions
   - Statistics display

**Key Hooks:**

1. **useFileStatus** ([hooks/useFileStatus.ts](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/hooks/useFileStatus.ts))
   - Subscribes to ingestion_file_status
   - Real-time file progress updates

2. **useDataSources** ([hooks/useDataSources.ts](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/hooks/useDataSources.ts))
   - Manages connectors
   - OAuth flows
   - File fetching

3. **useAuth** ([hooks/useAuth.ts](file:///Users/onronder/axial/frontend-new/hooks/useAuth.ts))
   - Supabase authentication
   - Session management

### 6.2 Backend Components

**Main Tasks (worker/tasks.py):**

1. **unified_ingest_task** (line 734)
   - Entry point for all ingestion
   - Implements fan-out pattern
   - Creates file status records

2. **process_file_task** (line 900)
   - Processes single file
   - Parsing → Embedding → Storage
   - Updates file status

3. **finalize_job_task** (line 1090)
   - Chord callback
   - Aggregates results
   - Updates job status

**Connectors:**

All connectors implement `BaseConnector` interface:
- `list_items(parent_id)` - List files/pages
- `fetch_content(item_ids)` - Download content
- `supports_oauth()` - OAuth indicator

