## 7. Database Schema

### Key Tables

**connector_definitions**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- type (TEXT, UNIQUE) -- 'google_drive', 'notion', 'web'
- name (TEXT)
- description (TEXT)
- is_active (BOOLEAN)
```

**user_integrations**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (UUID, FK)
- connector_definition_id (UUID, FK)
- access_token (TEXT, encrypted)
- refresh_token (TEXT, encrypted)
- credentials (JSONB)
- last_sync_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

**ingestion_jobs**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (UUID)
- provider (TEXT)
- total_files (INT)
- processed_files (INT)
- status (TEXT) -- 'pending', 'processing', 'completed', 'failed'
- progress (INT) -- 0-100
- status_message (TEXT)
- error_message (TEXT)
- created_at, updated_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

**ingestion_file_status**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- job_id (UUID, FK → ingestion_jobs)
- user_id (UUID)
- filename (TEXT)
- file_size_bytes (BIGINT)
- status (TEXT) -- 'pending', 'uploading', 'processing', 'embedding', 'indexing', 'completed', 'failed'
- progress (INT) -- 0-100
- status_message (TEXT)
- error_message (TEXT)
- chunks_total, chunks_processed (INT)
- document_id (UUID)
- created_at, updated_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

**documents**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (UUID)
- title (TEXT)
- source_type (TEXT) -- 'google_drive', 'notion', 'web', 'file'
- source_url (TEXT)
- file_size_bytes (BIGINT)
- indexing_status (TEXT)
- metadata (JSONB)
- created_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

**document_chunks**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- document_id (UUID, FK)
- user_id (UUID)
- content (TEXT)
- embedding (VECTOR(1536)) -- pgvector
- chunk_index (INT)
- token_count (INT)
- created_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

**failed_tasks**
```sql
- id (UUID, PK)
- task_id (TEXT)
- task_name (TEXT)
- user_id (UUID)
- error_message (TEXT)
- attempt_count (INT)
- status (TEXT) -- 'pending', 'retrying', 'resolved', 'permanent_failure'
- next_retry_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
- created_at, updated_at (TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

