## 8. APIs

### Backend API Endpoints

**Base URL:** `https://axial-production-1503.up.railway.app` or local `http://localhost:8080`

#### Integrations

**OAuth:**
- `POST /api/v1/integrations/google/exchange` - Exchange OAuth code
- `POST /api/v1/integrations/notion/exchange` - Exchange Notion code

**Connectors:**
- `GET /api/v1/integrations/available` - List all connectors
- `GET /api/v1/integrations/status` - User's connected integrations
- `GET /api/v1/integrations/{provider}/items?parent_id={id}` - List files/pages
- `POST /api/v1/integrations/{provider}/ingest` - Queue ingestion
- `DELETE /api/v1/integrations/{provider}` - Disconnect

#### Documents
- `GET /api/v1/documents` - List user documents
- `GET /api/v1/documents/stats` - Usage statistics
- `DELETE /api/v1/documents/{id}` - Delete document

#### Chat
- `POST /api/v1/chat` - Chat with RAG
- `GET /api/v1/conversations` - List conversations
- `GET /api/v1/conversations/{id}` - Get messages

#### DLQ (Dead Letter Queue)
- `GET /api/v1/dlq/my-tasks` - User's failed tasks
- `GET /api/v1/dlq/stats` - Failure statistics
- `POST /api/v1/dlq/retry/{task_id}` - Retry failed task
- `POST /api/v1/dlq/resolve/{task_id}` - Mark as resolved

