### Deployment Process

**Frontend (Vercel):**
1. Push to [main](file:///Users/onronder/axial/backend/worker/tasks.py#1570-1575) branch
2. Vercel auto-deploys
3. Build command: `npm run build`
4. Output: Static + SSR

**Backend (Railway):**
1. Push to [main](file:///Users/onronder/axial/backend/worker/tasks.py#1570-1575) branch
2. Railway auto-deploys
3. Dockerfile: [backend/Dockerfile](file:///Users/onronder/axial/backend/Dockerfile)
4. Start command: `gunicorn main:app`

**Worker (Railway):**
1. Same repo, separate service
2. Dockerfile: [backend/Dockerfile.worker](file:///Users/onronder/axial/backend/Dockerfile.worker)
3. Start command: `celery -A core.celery_app worker --pool=gevent --concurrency=10`

